Description: Supertonic: run TeraTTS v2 (distilled, own vocabulary)
 TeraTTS v2 has Supertonic's architecture with a 135-character vocabulary
 and a distilled sampler (guidance baked in, no unconditional tokens).
  - vocabulary size from the char_embedder weights instead of 8322;
  - distilled models (no uncond_masker tensors): one pass per step,
    x = (x + v / total) * mask;
  - request option raw_text: the caller prepared the text (language tags,
    stress marks), only NFKD and the indexer lookup;
  - tts.json "text": {"duration_skip": "+"}: characters left out of the
    duration predictor's input (Tera's stress marks).
 Output matches the TeraTTS ONNX pipeline (correlation 1.0000 on CPU and
 Vulkan with the same noise).
Author: Grigory Tuboltsev <gtubolcev@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
